{
  "score_support": "supports_wrong_score",
  "score_support_basis": "理由把“CodeChain生成程序”“sub-module generation”“self-revisions”等宽泛主题/方法组件当成可精确定位的论文部分，并据此断言“precise and obvious”，主要推出CoT的错误分数5；而真实标签3的核心是定位不自信但问题描述具体，理由未支持该grounding不足的判断。",
  "error_sentences": [
    {
      "sentence": "The comment is fully grounded because it explicitly mentions specific parts of the paper: the evaluation of programs generated by CodeChain on a Likert scale, the effectiveness of sub-module generation, and the analysis on the chain of self-revisions.",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "评分标准中fully grounded要求能精确定位section/table/figure或独特方面；该评论只给宽泛主题与“Correctness/Soundness”类别，未指明具体段落、表或图，达不到fully grounded门槛。"
    },
    {
      "sentence": "These references are precise and obvious to the authors.",
      "error_type": "unsupported_inference",
      "explanation": "材料不能推出作者能显然定位；这些引用是方法组件层面的泛指，作者无法自信确定对应部分，‘precise and obvious’属于凭空增强。"
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Thus, the comment meets the criteria for a score of 5.",
      "error_type": "score_mapping_error",
      "explanation": "按其自身证据最多说明评论具体说明了问题，但定位并不明确，符合3档‘不能自信定位但清楚说明要处理什么’，而非5档。"
    }
  ],
  "overall_basis": "CoT高估了grounding，把不可精确定位的主题引用误判为明确指向论文具体部分，因此证据主要支持错误分数5；真正符合的是具体但定位不明确的3档。"
}
